  "goodToKnow": "Der Favorit (die Favoritin) is the favourite to win: Wer ist Favorit auf den Titel? It's a weak noun: den Favoriten. In everyday speech, a personal favourite is usually expressed with Lieblings-: mein Lieblingsfilm, though mein Favorit is also common. Der Außenseiter is the underdog. Die Favoritenrolle is the role of favourite, which German teams often play down."
